      <p style="line-height: 1.6;">Shri Girish Mathrubootham, CEO of FreshDesk, Dr. Pawan Agarwal, CEO of the Mumbai Dabbawala Circuit, Dr. B.N. Ramesh, Addl. DGP, West Bengal and former Director, CRPF Academy participated in the inaugural function.</p>
