      <p style="line-height: 1.6;">Events of various clusters related to all branches of engineering -PARVARTANA, YANTRIKA, JIVAZASTRA, SAMAYIKA and SAGGANITRA provided a platform for students to test their technical skills.</p>
      <p style="line-height: 1.6;">Many workshops were conducted to impart hands-on experience to the students. Omnithopter, conducted by Aerotrix, taught the principles involved in aerodynamics. Bridge Design, conducted by Civil Simplifield, delved into the construction of a bridge. Spybotics, industry technologies, was all about building customised spy robots. Raspberry Pi, by 'Robot Technologies', taught how one could master engineering projects with this emerging microcomputer. Big Data, conducted by HT India Labs, offered tips on tackling computational bottlenecks.</p>
